--   ('1277a5b6-b979-4e3b-b5b6-e10aedfbedfb'::uuid, $plsc${"title":"Espace : calculer un produit scalaire","description":"Produit scalaire en repère orthonormé (coordonnées, AB·AC) et par polarisation (pièges : z oublié, OB·OC, division par 2 oubliée)","variations":[{"blanks":[{"expectedAnswer":"{{eval:u1*v1+u2*v2+u3*v3}}"}],"statement":"Dans l'espace muni d'un repère orthonormé, on considère les vecteurs $\\vec{u}\\begin{pmatrix}{{u1}}\\\\{{u2}}\\\\{{u3}}\\end{pmatrix}$ et $\\vec{v}\\begin{pmatrix}{{v1}}\\\\{{v2}}\\\\{{v3}}\\end{pmatrix}$.\n\nCalcule $\\vec{u}\\cdot\\vec{v}$.\n\n$\\vec{u}\\cdot\\vec{v}=?$","variables":[{"name":"u1","expression":"-6..6"},{"name":"u2","expression":"-6..6"},{"name":"u3","expression":"-6..6"},{"name":"v1","expression":"-6..6"},{"name":"v2","expression":"-6..6"},{"name":"v3","expression":"-6..6"}],"conditions":["u3 != 0","v3 != 0"],"correction":{"steps":["Dans un repère orthonormé, $\\vec{u}\\cdot\\vec{v}=xx'+yy'+zz'$.","$\\vec{u}\\cdot\\vec{v}={{u1}}\\times{{v1;()}}+{{u2;()}}\\times{{v2;()}}+{{u3;()}}\\times{{v3;()}}=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{ {{eval:u1*v1+u2*v2+u3*v3}} }$"]}},{"blanks":[{"expectedAnswer":"{{eval:(bx-ax)*(cx-ax)+(by-ay)*(cy-ay)+(bz-az)*(cz-az)}}"}],"statement":"Dans l'espace muni d'un repère orthonormé, on considère les points $A({{ax}}\\,;\\,{{ay}}\\,;\\,{{az}})$, $B({{bx}}\\,;\\,{{by}}\\,;\\,{{bz}})$ et $C({{cx}}\\,;\\,{{cy}}\\,;\\,{{cz}})$.\n\nCalcule $\\overrightarrow{AB}\\cdot\\overrightarrow{AC}$.\n\n$\\overrightarrow{AB}\\cdot\\overrightarrow{AC}=?$","variables":[{"name":"ax","expression":"-5..5"},{"name":"ay","expression":"-5..5"},{"name":"az","expression":"-5..5"},{"name":"bx","expression":"-5..5"},{"name":"by","expression":"-5..5"},{"name":"bz","expression":"-5..5"},{"name":"cx","expression":"-5..5"},{"name":"cy","expression":"-5..5"},{"name":"cz","expression":"-5..5"}],"conditions":["abs(bx-ax)+abs(by-ay)+abs(bz-az) > 0","abs(cx-ax)+abs(cy-ay)+abs(cz-az) > 0","az != 0"],"correction":{"steps":["$\\overrightarrow{AB}\\begin{pmatrix}{{eval:bx-ax}}\\\\{{eval:by-ay}}\\\\{{eval:bz-az}}\\end{pmatrix}$ et $\\overrightarrow{AC}\\begin{pmatrix}{{eval:cx-ax}}\\\\{{eval:cy-ay}}\\\\{{eval:cz-az}}\\end{pmatrix}$.","$\\overrightarrow{AB}\\cdot\\overrightarrow{AC}={{eval:bx-ax}}\\times{{eval:cx-ax;()}}+{{eval:by-ay;()}}\\times{{eval:cy-ay;()}}+{{eval:bz-az;()}}\\times{{eval:cz-az;()}}=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{ {{eval:(bx-ax)*(cx-ax)+(by-ay)*(cy-ay)+(bz-az)*(cz-az)}} }$"]}},{"blanks":[{"expectedAnswer":"{{eval:(c^2-a^2-b^2)/2}}"}],"statement":"Dans l'espace, $\\vec{u}$ et $\\vec{v}$ sont deux vecteurs tels que $\\|\\vec{u}\\|={{a}}$, $\\|\\vec{v}\\|={{b}}$ et $\\|\\vec{u}+\\vec{v}\\|={{c}}$.\n\nCalcule $\\vec{u}\\cdot\\vec{v}$.\n\n$\\vec{u}\\cdot\\vec{v}=?$","variables":[{"name":"a","expression":"2..8"},{"name":"b","expression":"2..8"},{"name":"c","expression":"2..12"}],"conditions":["c < a+b","c > abs(a-b)","c*c != a*a+b*b"],"correction":{"steps":["$\\|\\vec{u}+\\vec{v}\\|^2=\\|\\vec{u}\\|^2+2\\,\\vec{u}\\cdot\\vec{v}+\\|\\vec{v}\\|^2$, donc $\\vec{u}\\cdot\\vec{v}=\\dfrac{1}{2}\\left(\\|\\vec{u}+\\vec{v}\\|^2-\\|\\vec{u}\\|^2-\\|\\vec{v}\\|^2\\right)$.","$\\vec{u}\\cdot\\vec{v}=\\dfrac{1}{2}\\left({{c}}^2-{{a}}^2-{{b}}^2\\right)=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{ {{eval:(c^2-a^2-b^2)/2}} }$"]}}],"shared":{"blankDefaults":{"acceptDecimal":true}},"test_specs":[{"answers":["-3"],"expected":{"status":"correct"},"variables":{"u1":"2","u2":"-1","u3":"3","v1":"4","v2":"5","v3":"-2"},"description":"v0 : -3","variationIndex":0},{"answers":["3"],"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"u1":"2","u2":"-1","u3":"3","v1":"4","v2":"5","v3":"-2"},"description":"v0 : z oublié (3)","variationIndex":0},{"answers":["-1"],"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"u1":"2","u2":"-1","u3":"3","v1":"4","v2":"5","v3":"-2"},"description":"v0 : produits en croix mal appariés","variationIndex":0},{"answers":["6"],"expected":{"status":"correct"},"variables":{"ax":"1","ay":"0","az":"-1",