--   ('68b13d33-57b5-4f5f-a3d0-ffbc80d78587'::uuid, $plsc${"title":"Espace : points alignés ? vecteurs formant une base ?","description":"Décider (QCM) si trois points sont alignés, si trois vecteurs forment une base de l'espace (colinéarité, coplanarité par un système)","variations":[{"choices":[{"content":"Oui, les points $A$, $B$ et $C$ sont alignés."},{"content":"Non, les points $A$, $B$ et $C$ ne sont pas alignés."}],"statement":"Dans l'espace muni d'un repère, on considère les points $A({{ax}}\\,;\\,{{ay}}\\,;\\,{{az}})$, $B({{bx}}\\,;\\,{{by}}\\,;\\,{{bz}})$ et $C({{cx}}\\,;\\,{{cy}}\\,;\\,{{cz}})$.\n\nLes points $A$, $B$ et $C$ sont-ils alignés ?","variables":[{"name":"ax","expression":"-4..4"},{"name":"ay","expression":"-4..4"},{"name":"az","expression":"-4..4"},{"name":"w1","expression":"1..3;±"},{"name":"w2","expression":"-3..3"},{"name":"w3","expression":"-3..3"},{"name":"k","expression":"2..3;±"},{"name":"o","expression":"0..1"},{"name":"bx","expression":"{{eval:ax+w1}}"},{"name":"by","expression":"{{eval:ay+w2}}"},{"name":"bz","expression":"{{eval:az+w3}}"},{"name":"cx","expression":"{{eval:ax+k*w1}}"},{"name":"cy","expression":"{{eval:ay+k*w2+o}}"},{"name":"cz","expression":"{{eval:az+k*w3}}"}],"correction":{"steps":["$A$, $B$, $C$ sont alignés si et seulement si $\\overrightarrow{AB}$ et $\\overrightarrow{AC}$ sont colinéaires. $\\overrightarrow{AB}\\begin{pmatrix}{{w1}}\\\\{{w2}}\\\\{{w3}}\\end{pmatrix}$ et $\\overrightarrow{AC}\\begin{pmatrix}{{eval:k*w1}}\\\\{{eval:k*w2+o}}\\\\{{eval:k*w3}}\\end{pmatrix}$.","Les abscisses imposent $\\overrightarrow{AC}={{k}}\\,\\overrightarrow{AB}$ si les vecteurs sont colinéaires. Or ${{k}}\\times{{w2;()}}={{eval:k*w2}}{{if:o==0|=}}{{if:o==1|\\neq}}{{eval:k*w2+o}}$.","{{if:o==0|On a bien $\\overrightarrow{AC}={{k}}\\,\\overrightarrow{AB}$ : les points **sont alignés**.}}{{if:o==1|Les vecteurs ne sont pas colinéaires : les points **ne sont pas alignés**.}}"]},"correctChoiceIndex":["{{o}}"]},{"choices":[{"content":"Oui, $(\\vec{u},\\vec{v},\\vec{w})$ est une base de l'espace."},{"content":"Non, ces trois vecteurs ne forment pas une base."}],"statement":"Dans l'espace muni d'un repère, on considère les vecteurs $\\vec{u}\\begin{pmatrix}{{u1}}\\\\{{u2}}\\\\{{u3}}\\end{pmatrix}$, $\\vec{v}\\begin{pmatrix}{{v1}}\\\\{{v2}}\\\\{{v3}}\\end{pmatrix}$ et $\\vec{w}\\begin{pmatrix}{{w1}}\\\\{{w2}}\\\\{{w3}}\\end{pmatrix}$.\n\nLes vecteurs $\\vec{u}$, $\\vec{v}$, $\\vec{w}$ forment-ils une base de l'espace ?","variables":[{"name":"u2","expression":"-3..3"},{"name":"u3","expression":"-3..3"},{"name":"v1","expression":"-3..3"},{"name":"v3","expression":"-3..3"},{"name":"u1","expression":"1"},{"name":"v2","expression":"1"},{"name":"pa","expression":"1..3;±"},{"name":"pb","expression":"1..3;±"},{"name":"o","expression":"0..1"},{"name":"w1","expression":"{{eval:pa*u1+pb*v1}}"},{"name":"w2","expression":"{{eval:pa*u2+pb*v2}}"},{"name":"w3","expression":"{{eval:pa*u3+pb*v3+o}}"}],"conditions":["u2*v1 != 1"],"correction":{"steps":["$\\vec{u}$ et $\\vec{v}$ ne sont pas colinéaires. Les trois vecteurs forment une base si et seulement si $\\vec{w}$ ne s'écrit pas $a\\,\\vec{u}+b\\,\\vec{v}$ (vecteurs non coplanaires).","Les deux premières coordonnées de $\\vec{w}=a\\,\\vec{u}+b\\,\\vec{v}$ donnent $a={{pa}}$ et $b={{pb}}$. Troisième : ${{pa}}\\times{{u3;()}}+{{pb;()}}\\times{{v3;()}}={{eval:pa*u3+pb*v3}}{{if:o==0|=}}{{if:o==1|\\neq}}{{w3}}$.","{{if:o==0|$\\vec{w}=a\\,\\vec{u}+b\\,\\vec{v}$ avec $a={{pa}}$ et $b={{pb}}$ : les vecteurs sont coplanaires, ils **ne forment pas une base**.}}{{if:o==1|Aucun couple $(a\\,;b)$ ne convient : les vecteurs ne sont pas coplanaires, ils **forment une base**.}}"]},"correctChoiceIndex":["{{eval:1-o}}"]}],"shared":{"cleanCoefficients":true},"test_specs":[{"expected":{"status":"correct"},"variables":{"k":"3","o":"0","ax":"1","ay":"0","az":"2","w1":"2","w2":"-1","w3":"1"},"description":"v0 : alignés → Oui","variationIndex":0,"selectedChoices":[0]},{"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"k":"3","o":"0","ax":"1","ay":"0","az":"2","w1":"2","w2":"-1","w3":"1"},"description":"v0 : alignés, Non coché","variationIndex":0,"selectedChoices":[1]},{"expected":{"status":"correct"},"variables":{"k":"3","o":"1","ax":"1","ay":"0","az":"2","w1":"2","w2":"-1","w3":"1"},"description":"v0 : non alignés → Non","variationIndex":0,"selectedChoices":[1]},{"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"k":"3","o":"1","ax":"1","ay":"0","az":"2","w1":"2","w2":"-1","w3":"1"},"description":"v0 : non alignés, Oui coché","variationIndex":0,"selectedChoices":[0]},{"expected":{"status":"correct"},"variables":{"o":"0","pa":"2","pb":"-1","u1":"1","u2":"2","u3":"-1","v1":"-1","v2":"1","v3":"3"},"description":"v1 : coplanaires → Non","variationIndex":1,"selectedChoices":[1]},{"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"o":"0","pa":"2","pb":"-1","u1":"1","u2":"2","u3":"-1","v1":"-1","v2":"1","v3":"3"},"description":"v1 : coplanaires, Oui coché","variationIndex":1,"selectedChoices":[0]},{"expected":{"status":"correct"},"variables":{"o":"1","pa":"2","pb":"-1","u1":"1","u2":"2","u3":"-1","v1":"-1","v2":"1","v3":"3"},"description":"v1 : base → Oui","variationIndex":1,"selectedChoices":[0]},{"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"o":"1","pa":"2","pb":"-1","u1":"1","u2":"2","u3":"-1","v1":"-1","v2":"1","v3":"3"},"description":"v1 : base, Non coché","variationIndex":1,"selectedChoices":[1]}]}$plsc$::jsonb),
--   ('6c80b4ec-541d-47dc-a652-13b51f9b8b9b'::uuid, $plsc${"title":"Loi binomiale : utiliser une table de P(X ⩽ k)","description":"Extrait de table des probabilités cumulées fourni : P(X > k), P(X = k), P(a ⩽ X ⩽ b), seuil, intervalle de fluctuation [a ; b] (pièges : 1 − P(X ⩽ k − 1), F(b) − F(a) au lieu de F(b) − F(a − 1))","variations":[{"blanks":[{"expectedAnswer":"{{r}}"}],"statement":"$X$ suit la loi binomiale $\\mathcal{B}(20\\,;0.3)$. On donne un extrait de la table de ses probabilités cumulées (arrondies à $10^{-4}$).\n\n| $k$ | $P(X\\leqslant k)$ |\n|---|---|\n| $2$ | $0.0355$ |\n| $3$ | $0.1071$ |\n| $4$ | $0.2375$ |\n| $5$ | $0.4164$ |\n| $6$ | $0.608$ |\n| $7$ | $0.7723$ |\n| $8$ | $0.8867$ |\n| $9$ | $0.952$ |\n| $10$ | $0.9829$ |\n\nEn utilisant uniquement cette table, calcule $P(X>{{k}})$.\n\n$P(X>{{k}})=?$","variables":[{"name":"k","expression":"3..9"},{"name":"f","expression":"{{if:k==3|0.1071|{{if:k==4|0.2375|{{if:k==5|0.4164|{{if:k==6|0.608|{{if:k==7|0.7723|{{if:k==8|0.8867|0.952}}}}}}}}}}}}"},{"name":"r","expression":"{{if:k==3|0.8929|{{if:k==4|0.7625|{{if:k==5|0.5836|{{if:k==6|0.392|{{if:k==7|0.2277|{{if:k==8|0.1133|0.048}}}}}}}}}}}}"}],"correction":{"steps":["$X>{{k}}$ est l'événement contraire de $X\\leqslant {{k}}$.","$P(X>{{k}})=1-P(X\\leqslant {{k}})=1-{{f}}=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{r}}}$."]}},{"blanks":[{"expectedAnswer":"{{r}}"}],"statement":"$X$ suit la loi binomiale $\\mathcal{B}(30\\,;0.4)$. On donne un extrait de la table de ses probabilités cumulées (arrondies à $10^{-4}$).\n\n| $k$ | $P(X\\leqslant k)$ |\n|---|---|\n| $7$ | $0.0435$ |\n| $8$ | $0.094$ |\n| $9$ | $0.1763$ |\n| $10$ | $0.2915$ |\n| $11$ | $0.4311$ |\n| $12$ | $0.5785$ |\n| $13$ | $0.7145$ |\n| $14$ | $0.8246$ |\n| $15$ | $0.9029$ |\n\nEn utilisant uniquement cette table, calcule $P(X={{k}})$.\n\n$P(X={{k}})=?$","variables":[{"name":"k","expression":"8..15"},{"name":"f","expression":"{{if:k==8|0.094|{{if:k==9|0.1763|{{if:k==10|0.2915|{{if:k==11|0.4311|{{if:k==12|0.5785|{{if:k==13|0.7145|{{if:k==14|0.8246|0.9029}}}}}}}}}}}}}}"},{"name":"g","expression":"{{if:k==8|0.0435|{{if:k==9|0.094|{{if:k==10|0.1763|{{if:k==11|0.2915|{{if:k==12|0.4311|{{if:k==13|0.5785|{{if:k==14|0.7145|0.8246}}}}}}}}}}}}}}"},{"name":"r","expression":"{{if:k==8|0.0505|{{if:k==9|0.0823|{{if:k==10|0.1152|{{if:k==11|0.1396|{{if:k==12|0.1474|{{if:k==13|0.136|{{if:k==14|0.1101|0.0783}}}}}}}}}}}}}}"}],"correction":{"steps":["$P(X\\leqslant {{k}})=P(X\\leqslant {{eval:k-1}})+P(X={{k}})$.","$P(X={{k}})=P(X\\leqslant {{k}})-P(X\\leqslant {{eval:k-1}})={{f}}-{{g}}=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{r}}}$."]}},{"blanks":[{"expectedAnswer":"{{r}}"}],"statement":"$X$ suit la loi binomiale $\\mathcal{B}(25\\,;0.5)$. On donne un extrait de la table de ses probabilités cumulées (arrondies à $10^{-4}$).\n\n| $k$ | $P(X\\leqslant k)$ |\n|---|---|\n| $8$ | $0.0539$ |\n| $9$ | $0.1148$ |\n| $10$ | $0.2122$ |\n| $11$ | $0.345$ |\n| $12$ | $0.5$ |\n| $13$ | $0.655$ |\n| $14$ | $0.7878$ |\n| $15$ | $0.8852$ |\n| $16$ | $0.9461$ |\n\nEn utilisant uniquement cette table, calcule $P({{a}}\\leqslant X\\leqslant {{b}})$.\n\n$P({{a}}\\leqslant X\\leqslant {{b}})=?$","variables":[{"name":"a","expression":"9..12"},{"name":"b","expression":"14..16"},{"name":"fb","expression":"{{if:b==14|0.7878|{{if:b==15|0.8852|0.9461}}}}"},{"name":"fa","expression":"{{if:a==9|0.0539|{{if:a==10|0.1148|{{if:a==11|0.2122|0.345}}}}}}"},{"name":"r","expression":"{{eval:fb-fa;d}}"}],"correction":{"steps":["$P({{a}}\\leqslant X\\leqslant {{b}})=P(X\\leqslant {{b}})-P(X\\leqslant {{eval:a-1}})$ : on retire les valeurs **strictement inférieures** à ${{a}}$.","$P({{a}}\\leqslant X\\leqslant {{b}})={{fb}}-{{fa}}=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{r}}}$."]}},{"blanks":[{"expectedAnswer":"{{r}}"}],"statement":"$X$ suit la loi binomiale $\\mathcal{B}(50\\,;0.2)$. On donne un extrait de la table de ses probabilités cumulées (arrondies à $10^{-4}$).\n\n| $k$ | $P(X\\leqslant k)$ |\n|---|---|\n| $10$ | $0.5836$ |\n| $11$ | $0.7107$ |\n| $12$ | $0.8139$ |\n| $13$ | $0.8894$ |\n| $14$ | $0.9393$ |\n| $15$ | $0.9692$ |\n| $16$ | $0.9856$ |\n| $17$ | $0.9937$ |\n| $18$ | $0.9975$ |\n\nDétermine le plus petit entier $k$ tel que $P(X\\leqslant k)\\geqslant {{s}}$.\n\n$k=?$","variables":[{"name":"j","expression":"1..3"},{"name":"s","expression":"{{if:j==1|0.9|{{if:j==2|0.95|0.99}}}}"},{"name":"r","expression":"{{if:j==1|14|{{if:j==2|15|17}}}}"},{"name":"fr","expression":"{{if:j==1|0.9393|{{if:j==2|0.9692|0.9937}}}}"},{"name":"fq","expression":"{{if:j==1|0.8894|{{if:j==2|0.9393|0.9856}}}}"}],"correction":{"steps":["La suite des $P(X\\leqslant k)$ est croissante : on cherche la première valeur de la table qui atteint ${{s}}$.","$P(X\\leqslant {{eval:r-1}})\\approx {{fq}}<{{s}}$ et $P(X\\leqslant {{r}})\\approx {{fr}}\\geqslant {{s}}$, donc $k=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{r}}}$."]}},{"blanks":[{"expectedAnswer":"{{ra}}"},{"expectedAnswer":"{{rb}}"}],"statement":"$X$ suit la loi binomiale $\\mathcal{B}(40\\,;0.25)$. On donne un extrait de la table de ses probabilités cumulées (arrondies à $10^{-4}$).\n\n| $k$ | $P(X\\leqslant k)$ |\n|---|---|\n| $3$ | $0.0047$ |\n| $4$ | $0.016$ |\n| $5$ | $0.0433$ |\n| $6$ | $0.0962$ |\n| $7$ | $0.182$ |\n| $\\ldots$ | $\\ldots$ |\n| $13$ | $0.8968$ |\n| $14$ | $0.9456$ |\n| $15$ | $0.9738$ |\n| $16$ | $0.9884$ |\n| $17$ | $0.9953$ |\n\nOn cherche l'intervalle $[a\\,;b]$, avec $a$ et $b$ entiers, tel que $a$ est le plus petit entier vérifiant $P(X\\leqslant a)>{{h}}$ et $b$ le plus petit entier vérifiant $P(X\\leqslant b)\\geqslant {{g}}$. On a alors $P(a\\leqslant X\\leqslant b)\\geqslant {{c}}$.\n\n$a=?$ et $b=?$","variables":[{"name":"j","expression":"1..2"},{"name":"h","expression":"{{if:j==1|0.025|0.05}}"},{"name":"g","expression":"{{if:j==1|0.975|0.95}}"},{"name":"c","expression":"{{if:j==1|0.95|0.9}}"},{"name":"ra","expression":"{{if:j==1|5|6}}"},{"name":"rb","expression":"{{if:j==1|16|15}}"}],"correction":{"steps":["$a$ : première valeur de la table **strictement** supérieure à ${{h}}$ : $P(X\\leqslant {{eval:ra-1}})\\leqslant {{h}}<P(X\\leqslant {{ra}})$, donc $a=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{ra}}}$.","$b$ : première valeur supérieure ou égale à ${{g}}$ : $P(X\\leqslant {{eval:rb-1}})<{{g}}\\leqslant P(X\\leqslant {{rb}})$, donc $b=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{rb}}}$.","L'intervalle $[{{ra}}\\,;{{rb}}]$ contient $X$ avec une probabilité au moins égale à ${{c}}$."]}}],"shared":{"blankDefaults":{"acceptDecimal":true}},"test_specs":[{"answers":["0,5836"],"expected":{"status":"correct"},"variables":{"k":"5"},"description":"v0 : P(X > 5) = 0,5836","variationIndex":0},{"answers":["0,4164"],"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"k":"5"},"description":"v0 : P(X ⩽ 5) lu tel quel","variationIndex":0},{"answers":["0,7625"],"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"k":"5"},"description":"v0 : 1 − P(X ⩽ 4)","variationIndex":0},{"answers":["0,1474"],"expected":{"status":"correct"},"variables":{"k":"12"},"description":"v1 : P(X = 12) = 0,1474","variationIndex":1},{"answers":["0,5785"],"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"k":"12"},"description":"v1 : P(X ⩽ 12) lu","variationIndex":1},{"answers":["0,7704"],"expected":{"status":"correct"},"variables":{"a":"10","b":"15"},"description":"v2 : P(10 ⩽ X ⩽ 15) = 0,7704","variationIndex":2},{"answers":["0,673"],"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"a":"10","b":"15"},"description":"v2 : F(b) − F(a) = 0,673","variationIndex":2},{"answers":["15"],"expected":{"status":"correct"},"variables":{"j":"2"},"description":"v3 : seuil 0,95 → 15","variationIndex":3},{"answers":["14"],"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"j":"2"},"description":"v3 : seuil 0,95, valeur juste avant 14","variationIndex":3},{"answers":["17"],"expected":{"status":"correct"},"variables":{"j":"3"},"description":"v3 : seuil 0,99 → 17","variationIndex":3},{"answers":["5","16"],"expected":{"status":"correct"},"variables":{"j":"1"},"description":"v4 : α = 0,05 → [5 ; 16]","variationIndex":4},{"answers":["4","16"],"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"j":"1"},"description":"v4 : a = 4 (≤ au lieu de >)","variationIndex":4},{"answers":["6","15"],"expected":{"status":"correct"},"variables":{"j":"2"},"description":"v4 : α = 0,1 → [6 ; 15]","variationIndex":4}]}$plsc$::jsonb),
--   ('71cb8ab7-664a-45f6-83b0-6b0739ebb5a1'::uuid, $plsc${"title":"Somme de variables aléatoires : espérance et variance","description":"E(aX + bY) = aE(X) + bE(Y) ; si X et Y indépendantes : V(X + Y) = V(X) + V(Y), V(X − Y) = V(X) + V(Y), V(aX + bY) = a²V(X) + b²V(Y), écart type de la somme (pièges : V(X) − V(Y), aV(X), σ(X) + σ(Y))","variations":[{"blanks":[{"expectedAnswer":"{{eval:a*u+b*w}}"}],"statement":"Deux variables aléatoires $X$ et $Y$ vérifient $E(X)={{u}}$ et $E(Y)={{w}}$.\n\nCalcule $E({{a}}X+{{b}}Y)$.\n\n$E({{a}}X+{{b}}Y)=?$","variables":[{"name":"u","expression":"1..9;±"},{"name":"w","expression":"1..9;±"},{"name":"a","expression":"2..5"},{"name":"b","expression":"2..5"}],"correction":{"steps":["Linéarité de l'espérance (vraie même si $X$ et $Y$ ne sont pas indépendantes) : $E(aX+bY)=aE(X)+bE(Y)$.","$E({{a}}X+{{b}}Y)={{a}}\\times{{u;()}}+{{b}}\\times{{w;()}}=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{eval:a*u+b*w}}}$."]}},{"blanks":[{"expectedAnswer":"{{eval:(u+w)/10}}"}],"statement":"Deux variables aléatoires **indépendantes** $X$ et $Y$ vérifient $V(X)={{eval:u/10;d}}$ et $V(Y)={{eval:w/10;d}}$.\n\nCalcule $V(X+Y)$.\n\n$V(X+Y)=?$","variables":[{"name":"u","expression":"5..60"},{"name":"w","expression":"5..60"}],"correction":{"steps":["$X$ et $Y$ sont indépendantes, donc $V(X+Y)=V(X)+V(Y)$.","$V(X+Y)={{eval:u/10;d}}+{{eval:w/10;d}}=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{eval:(u+w)/10;d}}}$."]}},{"blanks":[{"expectedAnswer":"{{eval:u+w}}"}],"statement":"Deux variables aléatoires **indépendantes** $X$ et $Y$ vérifient $V(X)={{u}}$ et $V(Y)={{w}}$.\n\nCalcule $V(X-Y)$.\n\n$V(X-Y)=?$","variables":[{"name":"u","expression":"5..20"},{"name":"w","expression":"1..4"}],"correction":{"steps":["$V(X-Y)=V(X)+V(-Y)$ par indépendance, et $V(-Y)=(-1)^{2}V(Y)=V(Y)$ : une variance ne diminue jamais quand on ajoute une variable indépendante.","$V(X-Y)={{u}}+{{w}}=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{eval:u+w}}}$."]}},{"blanks":[{"expectedAnswer":"{{eval:a^2*u+b^2*w}}"}],"statement":"Deux variables aléatoires **indépendantes** $X$ et $Y$ vérifient $V(X)={{u}}$ et $V(Y)={{w}}$.\n\nCalcule $V({{a}}X+{{b}}Y)$.\n\n$V({{a}}X+{{b}}Y)=?$","variables":[{"name":"u","expression":"1..9"},{"name":"w","expression":"1..9"},{"name":"a","expression":"2..4"},{"name":"b","expression":"2..3"}],"correction":{"steps":["Par indépendance, $V(aX+bY)=V(aX)+V(bY)=a^{2}V(X)+b^{2}V(Y)$.","$V({{a}}X+{{b}}Y)={{eval:a^2}}\\times{{u}}+{{eval:b^2}}\\times{{w}}=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{eval:a^2*u+b^2*w}}}$."]}},{"blanks":[{"expectedAnswer":"{{sz}}"}],"statement":"Deux variables aléatoires **indépendantes** $X$ et $Y$ ont pour écarts types $\\sigma(X)={{sx}}$ et $\\sigma(Y)={{sy}}$.\n\nCalcule $\\sigma(X+Y)$.\n\n$\\sigma(X+Y)=?$","variables":[{"name":"w","expression":"1..5"},{"name":"sx","expression":"{{if:w==1|3|{{if:w==2|6|{{if:w==3|5|{{if:w==4|8|9}}}}}}}}"},{"name":"sy","expression":"{{if:w==1|4|{{if:w==2|8|{{if:w==3|12|{{if:w==4|15|12}}}}}}}}"},{"name":"sz","expression":"{{if:w==1|5|{{if:w==2|10|{{if:w==3|13|{{if:w==4|17|15}}}}}}}}"}],"correction":{"steps":["Ce sont les **variances** qui s'ajoutent : $V(X+Y)={{sx}}^{2}+{{sy}}^{2}={{eval:sz^2}}$.","$\\sigma(X+Y)=\\sqrt{ {{eval:sz^2}} }=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{sz}}}$ (et non ${{sx}}+{{sy}}={{eval:sx+sy}}$)."]}}],"shared":{"blankDefaults":{"acceptDecimal":true}},"test_specs":[{"answers":["5"],"expected":{"status":"correct"},"variables":{"a":"2","b":"3","u":"4","w":"-1"},"description":"v0 : E(2X + 3Y), 4 et −1 → 5","variationIndex":0},{"answers":["3"],"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"a":"2","b":"3","u":"4","w":"-1"},"description":"v0 : a + b oubliés : 3","variationIndex":0},{"answers":["4,7"],"expected":{"status":"correct"},"variables":{"u":"12","w":"35"},"description":"v1 : 1,2 + 3,5 = 4,7","variationIndex":1},{"answers":["4,2"],"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"u":"12","w":"35"},"description":"v1 : produit","variationIndex":1},{"answers":["15"],"expected":{"status":"correct"},"variables":{"u":"12","w":"3"},"description":"v2 : V(X − Y) = 12 + 3 = 15","variationIndex":2},{"answers":["9"],"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"u":"12","w":"3"},"description":"v2 : V(X) − V(Y) = 9","variationIndex":2},{"answers":["61"],"expected":{"status":"correct"},"variables":{"a":"3","b":"2","u":"5","w":"4"},"description":"v3 : V(3X + 2Y), 5 et 4 → 61","variationIndex":3},{"answers":["23"],"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"a":"3","b":"2","u":"5","w":"4"},"description":"v3 : aV(X) + bV(Y) = 23","variationIndex":3},{"answers":["5"],"expected":{"status":"correct"},"variables":{"w":"1"},"description":"v4 : 3 et 4 → 5","variationIndex":4},{"answers":["7"],"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"w":"1"},"description":"v4 : σ(X) + σ(Y) = 7","variationIndex":4},{"answers":["25"],"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"w":"1"},"description":"v4 : variance 25","variationIndex":4}]}$plsc$::jsonb),
--   ('74363137-8fef-4a59-bb0a-ce1c0908198f'::uuid, $plsc${"title":"Norme d'une somme ou d'une différence","description":"Utiliser le développement de ‖u+v‖² et ‖u−v‖² pour calculer une norme ou un produit scalaire","variations":[{"blanks":[{"expectedAnswer":"{{R}}"}],"statement":"On donne $\\|\\vec{u}\\|={{a}}$, $\\|\\vec{v}\\|={{b}}$ et $\\vec{u}\\cdot\\vec{v}={{p}}$.\n\nCalcule $\\|\\vec{u}+\\vec{v}\\|^2$.\n\n$\\|\\vec{u}+\\vec{v}\\|^2=?$","variables":[{"name":"a","expression":"2..6"},{"name":"b","expression":"2..6"},{"name":"p","expression":"{{eval:max(-9,1-a*b)}}..{{eval:min(9,a*b-1)}}"},{"name":"R","expression":"{{eval:a^2+2*p+b^2}}"}],"conditions":["p != 0","abs(p) < a*b"],"correction":{"steps":["$\\|\\vec{u}+\\vec{v}\\|^2=(\\vec{u}+\\vec{v})\\cdot(\\vec{u}+\\vec{v})$ : on développe par bilinéarité (comme une identité remarquable).","$\\|\\vec{u}+\\vec{v}\\|^2=\\|\\vec{u}\\|^2+2\\,\\vec{u}\\cdot\\vec{v}+\\|\\vec{v}\\|^2$","Donc $\\|\\vec{u}+\\vec{v}\\|^2={{eval:a^2}}+2\\times {{p;()}}+{{eval:b^2}}=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{ {{R}} }$"]}},{"blanks":[{"expectedAnswer":"{{R}}"}],"statement":"On donne $\\|\\vec{u}\\|={{a}}$, $\\|\\vec{v}\\|={{b}}$ et $\\vec{u}\\cdot\\vec{v}={{p}}$.\n\nCalcule $\\|\\vec{u}-\\vec{v}\\|^2$.\n\n$\\|\\vec{u}-\\vec{v}\\|^2=?$","variables":[{"name":"a","expression":"2..6"},{"name":"b","expression":"2..6"},{"name":"p","expression":"{{eval:max(-9,1-a*b)}}..{{eval:min(9,a*b-1)}}"},{"name":"R","expression":"{{eval:a^2-2*p+b^2}}"}],"conditions":["p != 0","abs(p) < a*b"],"correction":{"steps":["$\\|\\vec{u}-\\vec{v}\\|^2=(\\vec{u}-\\vec{v})\\cdot(\\vec{u}-\\vec{v})$ : on développe par bilinéarité (comme une identité remarquable).","$\\|\\vec{u}-\\vec{v}\\|^2=\\|\\vec{u}\\|^2-2\\,\\vec{u}\\cdot\\vec{v}+\\|\\vec{v}\\|^2$","Donc $\\|\\vec{u}-\\vec{v}\\|^2={{eval:a^2}}-2\\times {{p;()}}+{{eval:b^2}}=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{ {{R}} }$"]}},{"blanks":[{"expectedAnswer":"{{R}}"}],"statement":"Deux vecteurs $\\vec{u}$ et $\\vec{v}$ vérifient $\\|\\vec{u}\\|={{a}}$, $\\|\\vec{v}\\|={{b}}$ et $\\|\\vec{u}+\\vec{v}\\|={{c}}$.\n\nCalcule $\\vec{u}\\cdot\\vec{v}$. Donne la valeur exacte.\n\n$\\vec{u}\\cdot\\vec{v}=?$","variables":[{"name":"a","expression":"2..6"},{"name":"b","expression":"2..6"},{"name":"c","expression":"2..9"},{"name":"R","expression":"{{eval:(c^2-a^2-b^2)/2}}"}],"conditions":["c > abs(a-b)","c < a+b","c^2 != a^2+b^2"],"correction":{"steps":["Par bilinéarité, $\\|\\vec{u}+\\vec{v}\\|^2=\\|\\vec{u}\\|^2+2\\,\\vec{u}\\cdot\\vec{v}+\\|\\vec{v}\\|^2$.","Donc $\\vec{u}\\cdot\\vec{v}=\\dfrac{1}{2}\\left(\\|\\vec{u}+\\vec{v}\\|^2-\\|\\vec{u}\\|^2-\\|\\vec{v}\\|^2\\right)$.","$\\vec{u}\\cdot\\vec{v}=\\dfrac{1}{2}\\left({{eval:c^2}}-{{eval:a^2}}-{{eval:b^2}}\\right)=\\dfrac{ {{eval:c^2-a^2-b^2}} }{2}=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{ {{R}} }$"]}},{"blanks":[{"expectedAnswer":"{{R}}"}],"statement":"On donne $\\|\\vec{u}\\|={{a}}$, $\\|\\vec{v}\\|={{b}}$ et $\\vec{u}\\cdot\\vec{v}={{p}}$.\n\nCalcule $\\|\\vec{u}-\\vec{v}\\|$. Donne sa valeur exacte sous la forme $k\\sqrt{n}$, où $k$ et $n$ sont des entiers et $n$ est le plus petit possible.\n\n$\\|\\vec{u}-\\vec{v}\\|=?$","variables":[{"name":"a","expression":"2..6"},{"name":"b","expression":"2..6"},{"name":"p","expression":"{{eval:max(-9,1-a*b)}}..{{eval:min(9,a*b-1)}}"},{"name":"N","expression":"{{eval:a^2-2*p+b^2}}"},{"name":"R","expression":"{{eval:sqrt(N)}}"}],"conditions":["p != 0","abs(p) < a*b","sqrt(N) != round(sqrt(N))"],"correction":{"steps":["$\\|\\vec{u}-\\vec{v}\\|^2=(\\vec{u}-\\vec{v})\\cdot(\\vec{u}-\\vec{v})$ : on développe par bilinéarité (comme une identité remarquable).","$\\|\\vec{u}-\\vec{v}\\|^2=\\|\\vec{u}\\|^2-2\\,\\vec{u}\\cdot\\vec{v}+\\|\\vec{v}\\|^2$","$\\|\\vec{u}-\\vec{v}\\|^2={{eval:a^2}}-2\\times {{p;()}}+{{eval:b^2}}={{N}}$","Une norme est positive, donc $\\|\\vec{u}-\\vec{v}\\|=\\sqrt{ {{N}} }=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{ {{R}} }$"]}}],"shared":{"blankDefaults":{"acceptDecimal":true}},"test_specs":[{"answers":["21"],"expected":{"status":"correct"},"variables":{"a":"3","b":"2","p":"4"},"description":"v0 : 21","variationIndex":0},{"answers":["17"],"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"a":"3","b":"2","p":"4"},"description":"v0 : facteur 2 oublié (17)","variationIndex":0},{"answers":["13"],"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"a":"3","b":"2","p":"4"},"description":"v0 : normes non élevées au carré (3+8+2 = 13)","variationIndex":0},{"answers":["13"],"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"a":"3","b":"2","p":"4"},"description":"v0 : ‖u‖² + ‖v‖² seulement (13)","variationIndex":0},{"answers":["5"],"expected":{"status":"correct"},"variables":{"a":"3","b":"2","p":"4"},"description":"v1 : 5","variationIndex":1},{"answers":["21"],"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"a":"3","b":"2","p":"4"},"description":"v1 : signe du double produit (21)","variationIndex":1},{"answers":["9-8+4"],"expected":{"status":"bad_form","constraintViolations":["form"]},"variables":{"a":"3","b":"2","p":"4"},"description":"v1 : calcul non effectué","variationIndex":1},{"answers":["\\frac{11}{2}"],"expected":{"status":"correct"},"variables":{"a":"3","b":"4","c":"6"},"description":"v2 : 11/2","variationIndex":2},{"answers":["5,5"],"expected":{"status":"correct"},"variables":{"a":"3","b":"4","c":"6"},"description":"v2 : 5,5 décimal exact","variationIndex":2},{"answers":["11"],"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"a":"3","b":"4","c":"6"},"description":"v2 : division par 2 oubliée (11)","variationIndex":2},{"answers":["-\\frac{1}{2}"],"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"a":"3","b":"4","c":"6"},"description":"v2 : normes non élevées au carré ((6−3−4)/2)","variationIndex":2},{"answers":["\\frac{22}{4}"],"expected":{"status":"unoptimal_form","constraintViolations":["reducedFractions"]},"variables":{"a":"3","b":"4","c":"6"},"description":"v2 : fraction non réduite 22/4","variationIndex":2},{"answers":["2\\sqrt{6}"],"expected":{"status":"correct"},"variables":{"a":"4","b":"2","p":"-2"},"description":"v3 : 2√6","variationIndex":3},{"answers":["\\sqrt{24}"],"expected":{"status":"unoptimal_form","constraintViolations":["reducedRadicals"]},"variables":{"a":"4","b":"2","p":"-2"},"description":"v3 : √24 non simplifiée","variationIndex":3},{"answers":["24"],"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"a":"4","b":"2","p":"-2"},"description":"v3 : carré de la norme donné (24)","variationIndex":3},{"answers":["4,9"],"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"a":"4","b":"2","p":"-2"},"description":"v3 : valeur approchée 4,9","variationIndex":3},{"answers":["\\sqrt{11}"],"expected":{"status":"correct"},"variables":{"a":"3","b":"2","p":"1"},"description":"v3 : √11","variationIndex":3},{"answers":["\\sqrt{21}"],"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"a":"3","b":"2","p":"1"},"description":"v3 : norme de u+v (√21)","variationIndex":3}]}$plsc$::jsonb),
--   ('7690e290-8eaa-4729-9d34-6fd58107e294'::uuid, $plsc${"title":"Affixe d'un vecteur, distance, milieu, parallélogramme","description":"z_B − z_A, AB = |z_B − z_A|, milieu (z_A + z_B)/2, quatrième sommet d'un parallélogramme (pièges : z_A − z_B, |z_B| − |z_A|, mauvais sommet)","variations":[{"blanks":[{"expectedAnswer":"{{eval:c-a}}+({{eval:d-b}})i"}],"statement":"Dans le plan complexe, $A$ et $B$ ont pour affixes $z_A={{a}}+({{b}})i$ et $z_B={{c}}+({{d}})i$. Donne l'affixe du vecteur $\\overrightarrow{AB}$.\n\nAffixe de $\\overrightarrow{AB}$ : $?$","variables":[{"name":"a","expression":"1..6;±"},{"name":"b","expression":"1..6;±"},{"name":"c","expression":"1..6;±"},{"name":"d","expression":"1..6;±"}],"conditions":["a != c","b != d"],"correction":{"steps":["L'affixe de $\\overrightarrow{AB}$ est $z_B-z_A$ (extrémité moins origine).","$z_B-z_A={{eval:c-a}}+({{eval:d-b}})i$."]}},{"blanks":[{"expectedAnswer":"{{eval:sqrt((c-a)^2+(d-b)^2)}}"}],"statement":"Dans le plan complexe, $A$ et $B$ ont pour affixes $z_A={{a}}+({{b}})i$ et $z_B={{c}}+({{d}})i$. Calcule la distance $AB$.\n\n$AB=?$","variables":[{"name":"a","expression":"1..6;±"},{"name":"b","expression":"1..6;±"},{"name":"c","expression":"1..6;±"},{"name":"d","expression":"1..6;±"}],"conditions":["a != c","b != d"],"correction":{"steps":["$AB=|z_B-z_A|$ et $z_B-z_A={{eval:c-a}}+({{eval:d-b}})i$.","$AB=\\sqrt{ {{eval:(c-a)^2}}+{{eval:(d-b)^2}} }=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{eval:sqrt((c-a)^2+(d-b)^2)}}}$."]}},{"blanks":[{"expectedAnswer":"{{eval:(a+c)/2}}+({{eval:(b+d)/2}})i"}],"statement":"Dans le plan complexe, $A$ et $B$ ont pour affixes $z_A={{a}}+({{b}})i$ et $z_B={{c}}+({{d}})i$. Donne l'affixe du milieu $I$ du segment $[AB]$.\n\n$z_I=?$","variables":[{"name":"a","expression":"1..7;±"},{"name":"b","expression":"1..7;±"},{"name":"c","expression":"1..7;±"},{"name":"d","expression":"1..7;±"}],"conditions":["mod(a+c+20, 2) == 0","mod(b+d+20, 2) == 0","a+c != 0","b+d != 0","a != c"],"correction":{"steps":["$z_I=\\dfrac{z_A+z_B}{2}$.","$z_A+z_B={{eval:a+c}}+({{eval:b+d}})i$, donc $z_I={{eval:(a+c)/2}}+({{eval:(b+d)/2}})i$."]}},{"blanks":[{"expectedAnswer":"{{eval:a+g-c}}+({{eval:b+h2-d}})i"}],"statement":"Dans le plan complexe, $A$, $B$ et $C$ ont pour affixes $z_A={{a}}+({{b}})i$, $z_B={{c}}+({{d}})i$ et $z_C={{g}}+({{h2}})i$. Donne l'affixe du point $D$ tel que $ABCD$ soit un parallélogramme.\n\n$z_D=?$","variables":[{"name":"a","expression":"1..5;±"},{"name":"b","expression":"1..5;±"},{"name":"c","expression":"1..5;±"},{"name":"d","expression":"1..5;±"},{"name":"g","expression":"1..5;±"},{"name":"h2","expression":"1..5;±"}],"conditions":["a+g-c != 0","b+h2-d != 0","c != a","c != g"],"correction":{"steps":["$ABCD$ est un parallélogramme si et seulement si $\\overrightarrow{AD}=\\overrightarrow{BC}$, soit $z_D-z_A=z_C-z_B$.","$z_D=z_A+z_C-z_B$, soit $z_D={{eval:a+g-c}}+({{eval:b+h2-d}})i$."]}}],"shared":{"cleanCoefficients":true},"test_specs":[{"answers":["3-3i"],"expected":{"status":"correct"},"variables":{"a":"1","b":"2","c":"4","d":"-1"},"description":"v0 A(1+2i), B(4−i) : 3 − 3i","variationIndex":0},{"answers":["-3+3i"],"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"a":"1","b":"2","c":"4","d":"-1"},"description":"v0 z_A − z_B → −3+3i","variationIndex":0},{"answers":["5+i"],"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"a":"1","b":"2","c":"4","d":"-1"},"description":"v0 z_A + z_B → 5+i","variationIndex":0},{"answers":["3\\sqrt{2}"],"expected":{"status":"correct"},"variables":{"a":"1","b":"2","c":"4","d":"-1"},"description":"v1 AB = 3√2","variationIndex":1},{"answers":["18"],"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"a":"1","b":"2","c":"4","d":"-1"},"description":"v1 AB² → 18","variationIndex":1},{"answers":["\\sqrt{17}-\\sqrt{5}"],"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"a":"1","b":"2","c":"4","d":"-1"},"description":"v1 |z_B| − |z_A| → √17 − √5","variationIndex":1},{"answers":["3+i"],"expected":{"status":"correct"},"variables":{"a":"1","b":"3","c":"5","d":"-1"},"description":"v2 A(1+3i), B(5−i) : 3+i","variationIndex":2},{"answers":["6+2i"],"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"a":"1","b":"3","c":"5","d":"-1"},"description":"v2 division par 2 oubliée → 6+2i","variationIndex":2},{"answers":["2+4i"],"expected":{"status":"correct"},"variables":{"a":"1","b":"1","c":"3","d":"2","g":"4","h2":"5"},"description":"v3 A(1+i), B(3+2i), C(4+5i) : D = 2+4i","variationIndex":3},{"answers":["6+6i"],"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"a":"1","b":"1","c":"3","d":"2","g":"4","h2":"5"},"description":"v3 z_B + z_C − z_A → 6+6i","variationIndex":3},{"answers":["-2i"],"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"a":"1","b":"1","c":"3","d":"2","g":"4","h2":"5"},"description":"v3 z_A + z_B − z_C → −2i","variationIndex":3}]}$plsc$::jsonb),
--   ('7d552757-61db-493a-a846-7d2cdc0ec631'::uuid, $plsc${"title":"Reconnaître une équation ou une inéquation sur le cercle trigonométrique","description":"Arc ou points du cercle (mesures principales) : retrouver cos x ⩾ a, sin x ⩾ a ou sin x = a (pièges : cosinus = abscisse et sinus = ordonnée confondus, sens, signe)","variations":[{"choices":[{"content":"$\\cos x\\geqslant{{eval:cos(n*\\pi/12)}}$"},{"content":"$\\cos x\\leqslant{{eval:cos(n*\\pi/12)}}$"},{"content":"$\\sin x\\geqslant{{eval:cos(n*\\pi/12)}}$"},{"content":"$\\sin x\\leqslant{{eval:cos(n*\\pi/12)}}$"}],"statement":"Sur le cercle trigonométrique ci-dessous, l'arc coloré représente l'ensemble des solutions dans $\\left]-\\pi\\,;\\pi\\right]$ d'une inéquation.\n\n```trig\npreset: custom\nangles: -{{n}}*pi/12, {{n}}*pi/12\nequation: cos(x) >= cos({{n}}*pi/12)\nmode: arc\nmesures: principales\n```\n\nDe quelle inéquation s'agit-il ?","variables":[{"name":"a","expression":"\\frac{\\pi}{6}|\\frac{\\pi}{4}|\\frac{\\pi}{3}"},{"name":"n","expression":"eval:12*a/\\pi"}],"correction":{"steps":["L'arc est symétrique par rapport à l'axe des abscisses et va de $-{{a}}$ à ${{a}}$ : ce sont les points d'**abscisse** (cosinus) supérieure ou égale à $\\cos{{a}}={{eval:cos(n*\\pi/12)}}$.","Il s'agit de $\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{\\cos x\\geqslant{{eval:cos(n*\\pi/12)}}}$."]},"correctChoiceIndex":["0"]},{"choices":[{"content":"$\\sin x\\geqslant{{eval:sin(n*\\pi/12)}}$"},{"content":"$\\sin x\\leqslant{{eval:sin(n*\\pi/12)}}$"},{"content":"$\\cos x\\geqslant{{eval:sin(n*\\pi/12)}}$"},{"content":"$\\cos x\\leqslant{{eval:sin(n*\\pi/12)}}$"}],"statement":"Sur le cercle trigonométrique ci-dessous, l'arc coloré représente l'ensemble des solutions dans $\\left]-\\pi\\,;\\pi\\right]$ d'une inéquation.\n\n```trig\npreset: custom\nangles: {{n}}*pi/12, {{eval:12-n}}*pi/12\nequation: sin(x) >= sin({{n}}*pi/12)\nmode: arc\nmesures: principales\n```\n\nDe quelle inéquation s'agit-il ?","variables":[{"name":"a","expression":"\\frac{\\pi}{6}|\\frac{\\pi}{4}|\\frac{\\pi}{3}"},{"name":"n","expression":"eval:12*a/\\pi"}],"correction":{"steps":["L'arc est symétrique par rapport à l'axe des ordonnées, en haut du cercle : ce sont les points d'**ordonnée** (sinus) supérieure ou égale à $\\sin{{a}}={{eval:sin(n*\\pi/12)}}$.","Il s'agit de $\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{\\sin x\\geqslant{{eval:sin(n*\\pi/12)}}}$."]},"correctChoiceIndex":["0"]},{"choices":[{"content":"$\\sin x={{eval:-sin(n*\\pi/12)}}$"},{"content":"$\\sin x={{eval:sin(n*\\pi/12)}}$"},{"content":"$\\cos x={{eval:-sin(n*\\pi/12)}}$"},{"content":"$\\cos x={{eval:sin(n*\\pi/12)}}$"}],"statement":"Sur le cercle trigonométrique ci-dessous, les points marqués représentent les solutions dans $\\left]-\\pi\\,;\\pi\\right]$ d'une équation.\n\n```trig\npreset: custom\nangles: -{{n}}*pi/12, -{{eval:12-n}}*pi/12\nequation: sin(x) = sin(-{{n}}*pi/12)\nmode: points\nmesures: principales\n```\n\nDe quelle équation s'agit-il ?","variables":[{"name":"a","expression":"\\frac{\\pi}{6}|\\frac{\\pi}{4}|\\frac{\\pi}{3}"},{"name":"n","expression":"eval:12*a/\\pi"}],"correction":{"steps":["Les deux points ont la même **ordonnée**, négative (ils sont sous l'axe des abscisses) : $\\sin\\left(-{{a}}\\right)=-\\sin{{a}}={{eval:-sin(n*\\pi/12)}}$.","Il s'agit de $\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{\\sin x={{eval:-sin(n*\\pi/12)}}}$."]},"correctChoiceIndex":["0"]}],"shared":null,"test_specs":[{"expected":{"status":"correct"},"variables":{"a":"\\frac{\\pi}{4}"},"description":"v0 : cos ≥ → correct","variationIndex":0,"selectedChoices":[0]},{"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"a":"\\frac{\\pi}{4}"},"description":"v0 : cos ≤ (sens) → incorrect","variationIndex":0,"selectedChoices":[1]},{"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"a":"\\frac{\\pi}{4}"},"description":"v0 : sin ≥ (cos/sin) → incorrect","variationIndex":0,"selectedChoices":[2]},{"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"a":"\\frac{\\pi}{4}"},"description":"v0 : sin ≤ → incorrec