--   ('acd9104c-e29e-4df6-89cc-3d549a21b3fb'::uuid, $plsc${"title":"Factoriser un polynôme dont une racine est connue, équation de degré 3","description":"P(z) = (z − r)Q(z) : trouver Q, factoriser z³ − a³, résoudre P(z) = 0 de degré 3 avec une racine réelle ou imaginaire pure connue (pièges : signe de la racine, solution conjuguée oubliée, racine connue oubliée)","variations":[{"blanks":[{"expectedAnswer":"{{r}}"},{"expectedAnswer":"{{p}}+({{q}})i"},{"expectedAnswer":"{{p}}-({{q}})i"}],"statement":"Soit $P(z)=z^3+({{A}})z^2+({{B}})z+({{C}})$. On admet que $P({{r}})=0$. Résous dans $\\mathbb{C}$ l'équation $P(z)=0$ (solutions dans l'ordre que tu veux).\n\n$z_1=?$, $z_2=?$ et $z_3=?$","variables":[{"name":"r","expression":"1..3;±"},{"name":"p","expression":"1..2;±"},{"name":"q","expression":"1..3"},{"name":"A","expression":"eval:-(r+2*p)"},{"name":"B","expression":"eval:2*p*r+p^2+q^2"},{"name":"C","expression":"eval:-r*(p^2+q^2)"}],"conditions":["A != 0","B != 0"],"correction":{"steps":["$P({{r}})=0$, donc $P(z)=(z-({{r}}))(z^2+({{eval:-2*p}})z+{{eval:p^2+q^2}})$ (identification des coefficients).","Pour le facteur de degré 2 : $\\Delta={{eval:4*p^2-4*(p^2+q^2)}}$, négatif : deux solutions conjuguées.","Solutions : ${{r}}$, ${{p}}+({{q}})i$ et ${{p}}-({{q}})i$."]}},{"blanks":[{"expectedAnswer":"z^2+({{eval:-2*p}})z+{{eval:p^2+q^2}}"}],"statement":"Soit $P(z)=z^3+({{A}})z^2+({{B}})z+({{C}})$. On admet que $P({{r}})=0$. Détermine le polynôme $Q$ de degré 2 tel que, pour tout complexe $z$, $P(z)=(z-({{r}}))Q(z)$.\n\n$Q(z)=?$","variables":[{"name":"r","expression":"1..3;±"},{"name":"p","expression":"1..2;±"},{"name":"q","expression":"1..3"},{"name":"A","expression":"eval:-(r+2*p)"},{"name":"B","expression":"eval:2*p*r+p^2+q^2"},{"name":"C","expression":"eval:-r*(p^2+q^2)"}],"conditions":["A != 0","B != 0"],"correction":{"steps":["On cherche $Q(z)=z^2+bz+c$ : en développant $(z-({{r}}))(z^2+bz+c)$, on identifie $b-({{r}})={{A}}$ et $-({{r}})c={{C}}$.","$b={{eval:-2*p}}$ et $c={{eval:p^2+q^2}}$, donc $Q(z)=z^2+({{eval:-2*p}})z+{{eval:p^2+q^2}}$."]}},{"blanks":[{"expectedAnswer":"z^2+{{a}}z+{{eval:a^2}}"}],"statement":"Factorise $z^3-{{eval:a^3}}$ par $z-{{a}}$ : trouve le polynôme $Q$ tel que $z^3-{{eval:a^3}}=(z-{{a}})Q(z)$.\n\n$Q(z)=?$","variables":[{"name":"a","expression":"2..5"}],"correction":{"steps":["$z^3-a^3=(z-a)(z^2+az+a^2)$, avec ici $a={{a}}$.","$Q(z)=z^2+{{a}}z+{{eval:a^2}}$."]}},{"blanks":[{"expectedAnswer":"{{q}}i"},{"expectedAnswer":"-{{q}}i"},{"expectedAnswer":"{{r}}"}],"statement":"Soit $P(z)=z^3+({{eval:-r}})z^2+{{eval:q^2}}z+({{eval:-r*q^2}})$. Vérifie que $P({{if:q==1|i|{{if:q==-1|-i|{{eval:q}}i}}}})=0$, puis résous dans $\\mathbb{C}$ l'équation $P(z)=0$ (solutions dans l'ordre que tu veux).\n\n$z_1=?$, $z_2=?$ et $z_3=?$","variables":[{"name":"r","expression":"1..5;±"},{"name":"q","expression":"1..4"}],"correction":{"steps":["$P(z)=z^2(z-({{r}}))+{{eval:q^2}}(z-({{r}}))$, soit $P(z)=(z-({{r}}))(z^2+{{eval:q^2}})$.","$z^2+{{eval:q^2}}=0$ donne $z={{q}}i$ ou $z=-{{q}}i$ ; l'autre facteur donne $z={{r}}$."]}}],"shared":{"genericFunctions":["P","Q"],"cleanCoefficients":true},"test_specs":[{"answers":["1","-1+2i","-1-2i"],"expected":{"status":"correct"},"variables":{"A":"1","B":"3","C":"-5","p":"-1","q":"2","r":"1"},"description":"v0 r = 1, racines 1 et −1 ± 2i","variationIndex":0},{"answers":["-1-2i","1","-1+2i"],"expected":{"status":"correct"},"variables":{"A":"1","B":"3","C":"-5","p":"-1","q":"2","r":"1"},"description":"v0 dans un autre ordre","variationIndex":0},{"answers":["-1","-1+2i","-1-2i"],"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"A":"1","B":"3","C":"-5","p":"-1","q":"2","r":"1"},"description":"v0 racine connue de signe faux","variationIndex":0},{"answers":["1","-1+2i","-1+2i"],"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"A":"1","B":"3","C":"-5","p":"-1","q":"2","r":"1"},"description":"v0 conjuguée oubliée","variationIndex":0},{"answers":["z^2+2z+5"],"expected":{"status":"correct"},"variables":{"A":"1","B":"3","C":"-5","p":"-1","q":"2","r":"1"},"description":"v1 Q(z) = z² + 2z + 5","variationIndex":1},{"answers":["z^2-2z+5"],"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"A":"1","B":"3","C":"-5","p":"-1","q":"2","r":"1"},"description":"v1 signe de b → z² − 2z + 5","variationIndex":1},{"answers":["z^2+2z+4"],"expected":{"status":"correct"},"variables":{"a":"2"},"description":"v2 z³ − 8 → z² + 2z + 4","variationIndex":2},{"answers":["z^2-2z+4"],"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"a":"2"},"description":"v2 signe → z² − 2z + 4","variationIndex":2},{"answers":["z^2+4"],"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"a":"2"},"description":"v2 terme oublié → z² + 4","variationIndex":2},{"answers":["3i","-3i","2"],"expected":{"status":"correct"},"variables":{"q":"3","r":"2"},"description":"v3 P(z) = (z − 2)(z² + 9) : 3i, −3i, 2","variationIndex":3},{"answers":["3","-3","2"],"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"q":"3","r":"2"},"description":"v3 racines de z² + 9 réelles → ±3","variationIndex":3},{"answers":["3i","-3i","3i"],"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"q":"3","r":"2"},"description":"v3 racine réelle oubliée","variationIndex":3}]}$plsc$::jsonb),
--   ('aced2e6c-0f00-49ac-bcde-821d2bc91e9b'::uuid, $plsc${"title":"Échantillon de taille n : espérance et variance de Sₙ et Mₙ","description":"Pour un échantillon (X₁, …, Xₙ) d'espérance μ et de variance V : E(Sₙ) = nμ, V(Sₙ) = nV, E(Mₙ) = μ, V(Mₙ) = V/n, σ(Mₙ) = σ/√n (pièges : V/n² ou n²V, σ/n)","variations":[{"blanks":[{"expectedAnswer":"{{eval:n*m/10}}"}],"statement":"$(X_1, \\ldots, X_{ {{n}} })$ est un échantillon de taille ${{n}}$ d'une loi d'espérance $\\mu={{eval:m/10;d}}$. On pose $S=X_1+\\cdots+X_{ {{n}} }$.\n\nCalcule $E(S)$.\n\n$E(S)=?$","variables":[{"name":"n","expression":"10|20|25|50|100"},{"name":"m","expression":"5..80"}],"correction":{"steps":["Par linéarité, $E(S)=E(X_1)+\\cdots+E(X_{ {{n}} })=n\\mu$.","$E(S)={{n}}\\times{{eval:m/10;d}}=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{eval:n*m/10;d}}}$."]}},{"blanks":[{"expectedAnswer":"{{eval:n*v}}"}],"statement":"$(X_1, \\ldots, X_{ {{n}} })$ est un échantillon de taille ${{n}}$ d'une loi de variance $V={{v}}$. On pose $S=X_1+\\cdots+X_{ {{n}} }$.\n\nCalcule $V(S)$.\n\n$V(S)=?$","variables":[{"name":"n","expression":"5..30"},{"name":"v","expression":"2..9"}],"correction":{"steps":["Les $X_i$ sont **indépendantes** : les variances s'ajoutent, $V(S)=nV$.","$V(S)={{n}}\\times{{v}}=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{eval:n*v}}}$."]}},{"blanks":[{"expectedAnswer":"{{eval:v/n}}"}],"statement":"$(X_1, \\ldots, X_{ {{n}} })$ est un échantillon de taille ${{n}}$ d'une loi de variance $V={{v}}$. On note $M=\\dfrac{X_1+\\cdots+X_{ {{n}} }}{ {{n}} }$ la moyenne de l'échantillon.\n\nCalcule $V(M)$.\n\n$V(M)=?$","variables":[{"name":"n","expression":"10|20|25|40|50|100"},{"name":"v","expression":"2..12"}],"correction":{"steps":["$V(M)=V\\left(\\dfrac{S}{n}\\right)=\\dfrac{1}{n^{2}}V(S)=\\dfrac{nV}{n^{2}}=\\dfrac{V}{n}$.","$V(M)=\\dfrac{ {{v}} }{ {{n}} }=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{eval:v/n}}}$."]}},{"blanks":[{"expectedAnswer":"{{eval:s/sqrt(n)}}"}],"statement":"$(X_1, \\ldots, X_{ {{n}} })$ est un échantillon de taille ${{n}}$ d'une loi d'écart type $\\sigma={{s}}$. On note $M$ la moyenne de l'échantillon.\n\nCalcule l'écart type $\\sigma(M)$.\n\n$\\sigma(M)=?$","variables":[{"name":"n","expression":"4|9|16|25|36|49|64|100"},{"name":"s","expression":"1..12"}],"correction":{"steps":["$V(M)=\\dfrac{\\sigma^{2}}{n}$, donc $\\sigma(M)=\\dfrac{\\sigma}{\\sqrt{n}}$.","$\\sigma(M)=\\dfrac{ {{s}} }{\\sqrt{ {{n}} }}=\\dfrac{ {{s}} }{ {{eval:sqrt(n)}} }=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{eval:s/sqrt(n)}}}$."]}}],"shared":{"blankDefaults":{"acceptDecimal":true}},"test_specs":[{"answers":["70"],"expected":{"status":"correct"},"variables":{"m":"35","n":"20"},"description":"v0 : n = 20, μ = 3,5 → 70","variationIndex":0},{"answers":["3,5"],"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"m":"35","n":"20"},"description":"v0 : μ seul","variationIndex":0},{"answers":["40"],"expected":{"status":"correct"},"variables":{"n":"10","v":"4"},"description":"v1 : n = 10, V = 4 → 40","variationIndex":1},{"answers":["400"],"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"n":"10","v":"4"},"description":"v1 : n²V = 400","variationIndex":1},{"answers":["\\frac{3}{10}"],"expected":{"status":"correct"},"variables":{"n":"20","v":"6"},"description":"v2 : V = 6, n = 20 → 3/10","variationIndex":2},{"answers":["0,3"],"expected":{"status":"correct"},"variables":{"n":"20","v":"6"},"description":"v2 : 0,3 accepté","variationIndex":2},{"answers":["0,015"],"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"n":"20","v":"6"},"description":"v2 : V/n² = 0,015","variationIndex":2},{"answers":["\\frac{3}{2}"],"expected":{"status":"correct"},"variables":{"n":"16","s":"6"},"description":"v3 : σ = 6, n = 16 → 3/2","variationIndex":3},{"answers":["\\frac{3}{8}"],"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"n":"16","s":"6"},"description":"v3 : σ/n = 3/8","variationIndex":3},{"answers":["\\frac{9}{4}"],"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"n":"16","s":"6"},"description":"v3 : variance 9/4","variationIndex":3}]}$plsc$::jsonb),
--   ('b97dabe1-0c52-483e-a738-e62386d5a638'::uuid, $plsc${"title":"Croissances comparées : exponentielle, puissances, logarithme","description":"Limites de eˣ − kxⁿ, xⁿe⁻ˣ, xⁿeˣ en −∞, ln x / xⁿ, xⁿ ln x en 0 (pièges : x e⁻ˣ → +∞, ∞ × 0 = 1, limite d'un seul facteur)","variations":[{"blanks":[{"expectedAnswer":"+\\infty"}],"statement":"Soit $f$ la fonction définie sur $\\mathbb{R}$ par $f(x)=e^{x}-{{k}}x^{ {{n}} }$.\n\nDétermine la limite de $f$ en $+\\infty$.\n\n$\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}f(x)=?$","variables":[{"name":"k","expression":"1..9"},{"name":"n","expression":"2..5"}],"correction":{"steps":["Forme indéterminée « $\\infty-\\infty$ ». On factorise : $f(x)=e^{x}\\left(1-{{k}}\\dfrac{{{if:n==1|x|x^{ {{n}} }}}}{e^{x}}\\right)$.","Par croissances comparées, $\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\dfrac{{{if:n==1|x|x^{ {{n}} }}}}{e^{x}}=0$ : la parenthèse tend vers $1$.","Donc $\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}f(x)=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{+\\infty}$ : l'exponentielle l'emporte sur toute puissance."]}},{"blanks":[{"expectedAnswer":"0"}],"statement":"Soit $f$ la fonction définie sur $\\mathbb{R}$ par $f(x)={{k}}x^{ {{n}} }e^{-x}$.\n\nDétermine la limite de $f$ en $+\\infty$.\n\n$\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}f(x)=?$","variables":[{"name":"k","expression":"1..9"},{"name":"n","expression":"1..4"}],"correction":{"steps":["Forme indéterminée « $\\infty\\times0$ ». On écrit $f(x)={{k}}\\dfrac{{{if:n==1|x|x^{ {{n}} }}}}{e^{x}}$.","Par croissances comparées, $\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\dfrac{e^{x}}{{{if:n==1|x|x^{ {{n}} }}}}=+\\infty$, donc $\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\dfrac{{{if:n==1|x|x^{ {{n}} }}}}{e^{x}}=0$ et $\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}f(x)=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{0}$."]}},{"blanks":[{"expectedAnswer":"0"}],"statement":"Soit $f$ la fonction définie sur $\\mathbb{R}$ par $f(x)={{k}}x^{ {{n}} }e^{x}$.\n\nDétermine la limite de $f$ en $-\\infty$.\n\n$\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to-\\infty}f(x)=?$","variables":[{"name":"k","expression":"1..9"},{"name":"n","expression":"1..4"}],"correction":{"steps":["En $-\\infty$, ${{if:n==1|x|x^{ {{n}} }}}$ tend vers l'infini et $e^{x}$ vers $0$ : forme indéterminée « $\\infty\\times0$ ».","Par croissances comparées, $\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to-\\infty}{{if:n==1|x|x^{ {{n}} }}}e^{x}=0$, donc $\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to-\\infty}f(x)=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{0}$."]}},{"blanks":[{"expectedAnswer":"0"}],"statement":"Soit $f$ la fonction définie sur $\\left]0\\,;+\\infty\\right[$ par $f(x)=\\dfrac{ {{if:k==1||{{k}}}}\\ln x}{{{if:n==1|x|x^{ {{n}} }}}}$.\n\nDétermine la limite de $f$ en $+\\infty$.\n\n$\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}f(x)=?$","variables":[{"name":"k","expression":"1..9"},{"name":"n","expression":"1..3"}],"correction":{"steps":["Forme indéterminée « $\\dfrac{\\infty}{\\infty}$ ».","Par croissances comparées, $\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\dfrac{\\ln x}{{{if:n==1|x|x^{ {{n}} }}}}=0$ : la puissance l'emporte sur le logarithme.","$\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}f(x)=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{0}$."]}},{"blanks":[{"expectedAnswer":"0"}],"statement":"Soit $f$ la fonction définie sur $\\left]0\\,;+\\infty\\right[$ par $f(x)={{if:k==1||{{k}}}}{{if:n==1|x|x^{ {{n}} }}}\\ln x$.\n\nDétermine la limite de $f$ en $0$ (on a $x>0$).\n\n$\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to0}f(x)=?$","variables":[{"name":"k","expression":"1..9"},{"name":"n","expression":"1..3"}],"correction":{"steps":["En $0$, ${{if:n==1|x|x^{ {{n}} }}}$ tend vers $0$ et $\\ln x$ vers $-\\infty$ : forme indéterminée « $0\\times\\infty$ ».","Par croissances comparées, $\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to0}{{if:n==1|x|x^{ {{n}} }}}\\ln x=0$, donc $\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to0}f(x)=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{0}$."]}}],"shared":{"cleanCoefficients":true},"test_specs":[{"answers":["+\\infty"],"expected":{"status":"correct"},"variables":{"k":"3","n":"2"},"description":"v0 : eˣ − 3x² → +∞","variationIndex":0},{"answers":["-\\infty"],"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variab