  $plsc${"title":"Résoudre une équation en z et son conjugué","description":"αz + βz̄ = c en posant z = x + iy (piège : traiter z̄ comme z)","variations":[{"blanks":[{"expectedAnswer":"{{x}}+({{y}})i"}],"statement":"Résous dans $\\mathbb{C}$ l'équation ${{al}}z{{if:be==1|+|{{if:be==-1|-|{{be;+}}}}}}\\overline{z}={{u}}{{if:v==1|+i|{{if:v==-1|-i|{{eval:v;+}}i}}}}$, en posant $z=x+iy$ avec $x$ et $y$ réels.\n\n$z=?$","variables":[{"name":"al","expression":"2..4"},{"name":"be","expression":"1..3;±"},{"name":"x","expression":"1..4;±"},{"name":"y","expression":"1..4;±"},{"name":"u","expression":"eval:(al+be)*x"},{"name":"v","expression":"eval:(al-be)*y"}],"conditions":["al != be","al+be != 0"],"correction":{"steps":["Avec $z=x+iy$ et $\\overline{z}=x-iy$, le membre de gauche vaut ${{eval:al+be}}x+({{eval:al-be}})yi$.","On identifie parties réelles et parties imaginaires : ${{eval:al+be}}x={{u}}$ et ${{eval:al-be}}y={{v}}$, donc $x={{x}}$ et $y={{y}}$.","$z={{x}}+({{y}})i$."]}}],"shared":{"cleanCoefficients":true},"test_specs":[{"answers":["1+i"],"expected":{"status":"correct"},"variables":{"u":"3","v":"1","x":"1","y":"1","al":"2","be":"1"},"description":"v0 2z + z̄ = 3 + i → z = 1 + i","variationIndex":0},{"answers":["1+\\frac{1}{3}i"],"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"u":"3","v":"1","x":"1","y":"1","al":"2","be":"1"},"description":"v0 z̄ traité comme z : 3z = 3 + i → 1 + i/3","variationIndex":0},{"answers":["5-2i"],"expected":{"status":"correct"},"variables":{"u":"5","v":"-10","x":"5","y":"-2","al":"3","be":"-2"},"description":"v0 3z − 2z̄ = 5 − 10i → z = 5 − 2i","variationIndex":0},{"answers":["5+2i"],"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"u":"5","v":"-10","x":"5","y":"-2","al":"3","be":"-2"},"description":"v0 signe de y → 5+2i","variationIndex":0}]}$plsc$::jsonb,
