  $plsc${"title":"Loi exponentielle : absence de mémoire","description":"P(X > s + t | X > s) = P(X > t) = e^(−λt) (piège : mémoire non utilisée)","variations":[{"blanks":[{"expectedAnswer":"e^{-{{eval:k*t/10;d}}}"}],"statement":"La durée de vie $X$, en années, d'un composant suit la loi exponentielle de paramètre $\\lambda={{eval:k/10;d}}$. Le composant fonctionne encore après ${{s}}$ ans.\n\nDonne la valeur exacte de la probabilité qu'il fonctionne encore ${{t}}$ ans de plus.\n\n$P_{(X>{{s}})}(X>{{eval:s+t}})=?$","variables":[{"name":"k","expression":"1..9"},{"name":"s","expression":"2..10"},{"name":"t","expression":"1..5"}],"correction":{"steps":["La loi exponentielle est **sans mémoire** : $P_{(X>s)}(X>s+t)=P(X>t)=e^{-\\lambda t}$ (l'âge déjà atteint ne compte pas).","$P_{(X>{{s}})}(X>{{eval:s+t}})=P(X>{{t}})=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{e^{-{{eval:k*t/10;d}}}}$."]}}],"shared":{"blankDefaults":{"acceptDecimal":true}},"test_specs":[{"answers":["e^{-0,6}"],"expected":{"status":"correct"},"variables":{"k":"2","s":"5","t":"3"},"description":"v0 : λ = 0,2, s = 5, t = 3 → e^(−0,6)","variationIndex":0},{"answers":["e^{-1,6}"],"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"k":"2","s":"5","t":"3"},"description":"v0 : sans mémoire oubliée e^(−1,6)","variationIndex":0},{"answers":["1-e^{-0,6}"],"expected":{"status":"incorrect"},"variables":{"k":"2","s":"5","t":"3"},"description":"v0 : 1 − e^(−0,6)","variationIndex":0}]}$plsc$::jsonb,
